[gd_scene format=3]

; Guard: held, Alt, from wherever it is carried. While it is held you walk slowly, and the kit's
; hits on you do a quarter of their damage (brawl.cpp asks ctx.Using). Other weapons' damage is
; not reduced: that is the combat mod's to take, and no mod can change another's damage.
;   Guard       CbItem     a press, and while held; its own key Alt; says brawl.guard.up
;     Brace     CbMove     while it is held: walk and sprint 1.5 m/s, no jump

